1. Introduction
This project focuses on developing a secure notepad application that protects user data through encryption. Unlike a regular notepad, this application will automatically encryptsaved text files and automatically decrypt them if provided with the right key. The project aims to strengthen my understanding of encryption, algorithm design, and secure application development, while also improving my ability to document and test software systematically.
2. Objective
The objective of this project is to create a notepad application which will keep your information secure by methods of encryption.
This project will be developed within four weeks.

Specifically, the project aims to:
	- Teach encryption methods.
	- Teach algoritms to implement the encryption methods.
	- Demonstrate how to integrate encryption with a user-friendly application.
My contribution:
	- Research: Finding resources and learning skills to apply in my project.
	- Design: A clean and intuitive user interface.
	- Coding: Developing the algoritms for encryption.
	- Testing: Ensuring the encryption works properly.
	- Documentation: Recording the entire process and results.
3. Main Questions
- What are the most adequate encryption methods for my app (secure,efficient)?
- How can we apply encryption methods to keep our personal information safe?
